<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional 6.5 pct in year to Feb.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional 6.5 pct in year to Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)		     Feb</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)		    0.2</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)			6.5</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted)	 -0.9</p>
<p>    M0 annual (Unadjusted	    +6.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The consensus forecast was for 7.0 pct growth in seasonally adjusted February M0.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
